<title>UK: BOE allots 250 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 250 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 250 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted all 250 million stg in repos to July 21 in response to a forecast money market shortage of 400 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
